WEBVTT

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.170
﻿Flaminia wasn't only a doctor,
﻿she was also a fighter.

00:01:36.170 --> 00:01:40.090
﻿The ones who called in the G-IT Corps
﻿were her and her assistant, Yaan.

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:44.670
﻿I know Captain Elle Kind works
﻿for the Hermes Foundation,

00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.930
﻿but he turned out to be a swell old man.

00:01:47.260 --> 00:01:50.350
﻿Flaminia knocked me out,

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:53.730
﻿so I have no recollection
﻿of what happened after that.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.810
﻿So, about the G-IT Corps...

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.930
﻿- Sorry to barge in.
- ﻿Nah.

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:38.650
﻿The G-IT Corps seems to be
﻿on edge for some reason.

00:02:38.650 --> 00:02:41.270
﻿- Are they?
- ﻿Captain, if we don't do something

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:43.610
﻿they're going to board the Megafauna.

00:02:43.610 --> 00:02:48.070
﻿I know that. Can we really trust this map?

00:02:48.070 --> 00:02:51.570
﻿Flaminia went pale when she saw it,

00:02:51.580 --> 00:02:53.490
﻿so I'm sure we can trust it.

00:02:53.490 --> 00:02:56.960
﻿This disc has a diameter of 100 km,

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.380
﻿and it has a sea with a depth
of 150 meters, according to this.

00:03:00.380 --> 00:03:03.960
﻿The disc's ceiling is
﻿3000 meters high, right?

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:07.090
﻿Does the G-IT Corps's laboratory
﻿look out over this sea?

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:10.890
﻿Since they're an organization that
﻿passes down technology from long ago,

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.890
﻿they must need an ocean for
﻿machine testing purposes.

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:18.180
﻿Only the Rosario Ten Police could have sent
﻿out a formation of Mobile Suits like this.

00:03:18.520 --> 00:03:22.730
﻿Our philosophy is the right path
﻿for the Regild Century.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:26.650
﻿But it's clear that Rosario Ten
﻿will never understand that.

00:03:38.120 --> 00:03:41.330
﻿If this big shot, La Gu, is at Rosario Ten,

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:43.130
﻿we can just head straight there.

00:03:43.130 --> 00:03:48.920
﻿The G-IT Corps is sending the Crescent Ship to
﻿their lab which is one stop away from there.

00:03:48.920 --> 00:03:50.840
﻿Well, that means one thing.

00:03:50.840 --> 00:03:54.300
﻿If the Megafauna launches out of
﻿here and heads for Rosario Ten,

00:03:54.310 --> 00:03:58.100
﻿they won't be able to attack us with beams.

00:03:58.100 --> 00:04:00.230
﻿Then let's head for the G-IT Lab.

00:04:00.230 --> 00:04:03.270
﻿- What are you thinking?
- ﻿What? What?

00:04:03.270 --> 00:04:06.440
﻿It's called the G-IT Lab, so
﻿it must be a research facility.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:10.280
- ﻿If it's not a military installation...
- ﻿That means there'll be no resistance!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:15.950
﻿Those people expect an enemy approach
﻿even less than Towasanga did!

00:04:15.950 --> 00:04:18.200
﻿Leave it to a Towasangan to know!

00:04:18.870 --> 00:04:20.330
﻿Miss Aida!

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.120
﻿What are you people thinking?

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:25.830
The G-IT Corps are saying
﻿they'll make Kuntala out of us.

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:29.460
﻿The idea of being turned into
﻿rations for them repulses me.

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:30.840
﻿They're on the move.

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.390
﻿Captain!

00:04:35.850 --> 00:04:37.850
﻿We still can't get the G-Self to move.

00:04:38.220 --> 00:04:42.980
﻿Doesn't matter. Worst case scenario, we ram
﻿it into a Ten Police Poligit and blow it up.

00:04:43.650 --> 00:04:47.730
﻿When we do, check the resonance reaction
﻿it has with the Crescent Ship's engine.

00:04:48.070 --> 00:04:52.820
﻿If we do that, we'll learn the secret behind
﻿the Crescent Ship's improved performance.

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:55.450
﻿Compared to before,

00:04:55.450 --> 00:05:00.330
﻿the current Crescent Ship has cut its travel
﻿time by somewhere between 10% and 20%.

00:05:00.660 --> 00:05:03.290
﻿We can apply that to our Full Moon as well.

00:05:03.290 --> 00:05:06.750
﻿Which means we should eliminate
﻿any resistance from the Ten Police.

00:05:06.750 --> 00:05:09.090
﻿Well, you've got that right.

00:05:13.010 --> 00:05:16.720
﻿If it's a laboratory, it
should be worth going there.

00:05:17.140 --> 00:05:20.640
﻿Sis, you rush straight for Rosario Ten.

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:24.810
﻿Right. I'll place my bets on
﻿this President La Gu person.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:28.310
﻿You don't have an air leak where
﻿she gave you the shot, do you?

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:31.190
﻿I had Annette fix it up.

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:32.610
﻿That's good.

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:34.780
﻿I'm glad my big sister's all worried for me.

00:05:35.700 --> 00:05:38.160
﻿Because you're an important
﻿fighting member of our group!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:41.200
﻿- What are they flirting for?
- ﻿Ignore it. Ignore it entirely.

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:45.120
﻿Bellri will be in the Arcane and
﻿Aida's taking a Grimoire, right?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:49.330
﻿Yeah, because he may be reckless,
﻿but he'll bring out the Arcane's potential.

00:05:49.340 --> 00:05:50.800
﻿I know, right?

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:54.130
﻿Good for you! Your big
﻿sister's recognized you!

00:05:54.130 --> 00:05:56.760
﻿Raraiya, Lieutenant Ringo, assemble!

00:05:56.760 --> 00:05:58.720
﻿What is it, Lieutenant Kerbes?

00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:00.470
﻿Oh, we're doing it, aren't we?

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.430
﻿The Capital Guard's traditional...

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:03.770
﻿...war cry!

00:06:03.770 --> 00:06:06.190
- ﻿With a trip to the G-IT Lab en route...
- ﻿Yeah!

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:09.900
﻿we're going to go meet
﻿this important La Gu person!

00:06:09.900 --> 00:06:11.360
﻿We can do this!

00:06:14.900 --> 00:06:16.780
﻿Looks like they're ready.

00:06:16.780 --> 00:06:19.700
﻿- I think so too.
﻿- That rubber's really something.

00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:22.660
﻿It's amazing. We can even use it here.

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:26.660
﻿The Recksnow is good to go.

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:28.290
﻿Don't worry about mine.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:30.580
﻿You did the Neodu's
﻿maintenance properly, right?

00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:34.170
- ﻿It's sparkling like Raraiya herself!
﻿- What?

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:39.180
- ﻿That's good. Do the one below next.
﻿- Right!

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:42.510
﻿What a slave driver.

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.770
﻿That Noredo...

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:45.770
﻿Noredo!

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.650
﻿What's wrong? Are you not feeling well?

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.110
﻿You're going into another
﻿Mobile Suit battle, right?

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:54.400
﻿We're not planning on getting into one here.

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:57.360
﻿Noredo, you hide yourself someplace safe.

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:58.490
﻿Okay?

00:06:58.990 --> 00:07:01.620
﻿Yeah. I'll hide.

00:07:01.620 --> 00:07:04.540
﻿Put on helmets! Put on helmets!

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:08.460
﻿Do up the fastener. When you live in space,

00:07:08.460 --> 00:07:10.790
﻿there's always so much to do!

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.040
﻿Hey, Noredo.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:16.260
﻿You're doing logistical support and studying
﻿history and political science too, yeah?

00:07:22.510 --> 00:07:24.680
﻿Do you read me over the contact link?

00:07:24.680 --> 00:07:26.310
﻿Yeah! What is it?

00:07:26.310 --> 00:07:29.310
﻿Let's turn off the red lights
﻿in the hangar as well.

00:07:29.310 --> 00:07:30.520
﻿Good call.

00:07:32.150 --> 00:07:36.530
﻿We need to destroy the Ten
﻿Police who are approaching now.

00:07:36.530 --> 00:07:41.990
﻿However, the Crescent Ship will head
﻿directly to the G-IT Lab's steel frame wharf.

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:47.540
﻿Captain, I'm monitoring your seat and
﻿the bomb I put on you with this camera.

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.370
﻿If you do anything stupid, we'll
﻿turn you into a human bomb,

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.290
﻿and blow the bridge away along with you.

00:07:52.290 --> 00:07:54.170
﻿I-I understand!

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.010
﻿That goes for the XO as well! You got that?

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.800
﻿U-Understood!

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:07.770
﻿I told you to get that G-Self
﻿moving! Why isn't it?!

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:09.480
﻿We're working on it!

00:08:09.480 --> 00:08:11.270
﻿Yaan, please hurry.

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:12.730
﻿This should suffice.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:17.360
﻿Why is the Crescent Ship not
﻿on a course to Rosario Ten?

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:21.950
﻿The Crescent Ship has suffered
﻿a mechanical malfunction.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:25.740
﻿Do you want us causing an
﻿explosion in Rosario Ten's port?

00:08:25.910 --> 00:08:29.870
﻿We also have some questions about why they
﻿returned without holding the Advent Festival.

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:33.040
﻿Now that we've started it,
﻿half-hearted measures...

00:08:33.040 --> 00:08:35.790
﻿...will not allow us to complete
﻿Operation Reconguista!

00:08:41.380 --> 00:08:46.760
﻿That's right! Aiming beams at the batteries
﻿or Ocean Ring is absolutely prohibited.

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:56.110
﻿The Ten Police used their weapons?

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:57.770
﻿Do they despise us that much?

00:08:58.860 --> 00:09:02.280
﻿Captain, main engine, critical point!

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:04.360
﻿Hold on! Specify course!

00:09:04.370 --> 00:09:06.450
﻿I'm doing it! Okay, Steer!

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:07.780
﻿Yes, sir!

00:09:13.920 --> 00:09:16.750
﻿- Captain!
﻿- I know! Bear with it.

00:09:19.130 --> 00:09:21.880
﻿There is no such thing as a cruel villain.

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.420
﻿I believe you.

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:25.130
﻿Approach the bow.

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:26.510
﻿Where is Bellri?

00:09:26.510 --> 00:09:28.890
﻿All hands to level one battle stations!

00:09:28.890 --> 00:09:31.430
﻿We have our orders, so let's do it!

00:09:31.430 --> 00:09:34.020
﻿No, Raraiya shouldn't need to go out.

00:09:34.020 --> 00:09:37.110
﻿I once descended to Earth on my own.

00:09:40.190 --> 00:09:42.150
﻿- Earthnoids incoming!
- What?

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:50.700
﻿Dr. Flaminia, get out of the way!

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:54.250
﻿Huh? What? It moved?

00:09:57.670 --> 00:09:58.880
﻿Get out!

00:10:02.840 --> 00:10:04.420
You did it, Bell!

00:10:05.180 --> 00:10:07.890
﻿- Okay, we're moving now!
﻿- What?!

00:10:11.310 --> 00:10:12.970
﻿Main nozzle, fire!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:21.770
﻿The Megafauna's destination
﻿is above the Venus Globe.

00:10:21.780 --> 00:10:23.570
﻿The G-IT Lab in the Ocean Ring.

00:10:24.110 --> 00:10:26.030
﻿- Where's Bellri?
- ﻿Bell! Bell!

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:29.610
﻿Bellri and Raraiya have
﻿taken back the G-Self.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:30.870
﻿They did it!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.870
﻿- What are you doing?
- ﻿Sorry.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:35.000
- ﻿Noredo, help.
- ﻿What is it?

00:10:35.000 --> 00:10:36.580
﻿Cleaning up after Bellri.

00:10:36.580 --> 00:10:39.500
﻿- Huh?
- ﻿He must have pushed someone out.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:43.550
﻿Oh, right! Ressel, how do you
﻿zoom in with the monitor?

00:10:45.380 --> 00:10:48.130
﻿- What happened?
﻿- I'm really sorry!

00:10:48.130 --> 00:10:51.050
- ﻿The G-Self was—
- ﻿Are you telling me they took it back?!

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:54.100
﻿I'm collecting them now.

00:10:54.100 --> 00:10:56.060
﻿I-I was so nervous

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:59.440
I hadn't noticed them. ﻿It's fine now.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:01.560
﻿- Thank you.
﻿- Thank goodness.

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.900
﻿Well, take care of
﻿Dr. Flaminia and Yaan for us.

00:11:04.900 --> 00:11:08.030
﻿- Y-Yes, ma'am! Actually—
- ﻿Don't say anything more than necessary!

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:11.320
﻿- No!
- ﻿Doctor!

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.950
﻿I'll work something out! You come
﻿up with a plan, Commander!

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:19.750
﻿Okay, you join up with the Crescent
﻿Ship and return to the lab.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:20.920
﻿Yes, sir!

00:11:20.920 --> 00:11:22.250
﻿Kun Soon!

00:11:31.260 --> 00:11:35.520
﻿Our G-IT Corps has risen up with the goal
﻿of carrying out Operation Reconguista.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:39.730
﻿Henceforth, anyone who stands in our way,
﻿even the Ten Police, will be given no quarter.

00:11:39.730 --> 00:11:43.610
﻿Rosario Ten on the Ocean Ring, you can
﻿hear this transmission as well, right?

00:11:47.740 --> 00:11:50.780
﻿Firing projectiles so close
﻿to the Venus Globe is taboo.

00:11:50.780 --> 00:11:52.700
﻿Leave this to the Gastima!

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:57.450
﻿She said loud and clear to
﻿stay out of our way!

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.300
﻿What?

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:08.260
﻿It's that far away?

00:12:28.570 --> 00:12:31.160
﻿A Poligit?! They were this fast?

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:35.740
﻿Kun! It looks like the Earthnoids
﻿got their hands on the G-Self!

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:39.160
But Dr. Flaminia was with it, too!
﻿I'll go take it back.

00:12:42.880 --> 00:12:44.880
﻿Nothing else for it!

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:51.840
﻿Huh?! What are you playing around for?

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:58.680
﻿Rayhunton Code confirmed.

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:01.560
﻿Sorry for letting some strangers
﻿mess around with you!

00:13:01.560 --> 00:13:03.600
﻿Who are you even apologizing to?

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:17.490
﻿What was I hesitating for?!

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:25.040
﻿- We'll rendezvous with the Megafauna.
﻿- I'm counting on you.

00:13:29.340 --> 00:13:32.300
﻿The G-Self will make contact
﻿with Rosario Ten's police.

00:13:33.130 --> 00:13:36.430
﻿Roger that. We're making
﻿contact with them as we speak.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.560
﻿Heading: Ocean Ring!

00:13:38.560 --> 00:13:41.520
﻿- How is it going?
﻿- They're acknowledging us.

00:13:41.520 --> 00:13:44.810
﻿Adam! The Neodu is bringing back the Arcane!

00:13:44.810 --> 00:13:46.520
- ﻿I'll head down below.
- ﻿Me too!

00:13:49.820 --> 00:13:52.360
﻿Raraiya! Are you okay?

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:56.030
﻿Yes. Destroying us wasn't
﻿the G-IT Corps's objective.

00:13:57.660 --> 00:13:59.240
﻿Why are you crying?

00:13:59.660 --> 00:14:01.580
﻿I'm not crying!

00:14:01.580 --> 00:14:04.370
﻿Then hurry up and bring the big armor here!

00:14:04.370 --> 00:14:05.580
﻿Yes, sir!

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.680
﻿Huh?

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:19.560
﻿I see! Inside the Venus Globe,
﻿they won't fight with beams.

00:14:19.560 --> 00:14:22.560
﻿They can't! Is it taboo?

00:14:27.610 --> 00:14:30.230
Aida, transferring to Arcane.

00:14:30.230 --> 00:14:32.150
﻿Roger.

00:14:32.150 --> 00:14:35.530
﻿Oliver, you transfer to the Grimoire.
﻿As for your Recten...

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:36.450
﻿Is something up?

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:41.120
﻿The Crescent Ship won't give any response

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:43.000
﻿other than that they are heading
﻿directly for the Ocean Ring.

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:44.910
﻿Captain Elle didn't say anything?

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.420
﻿The XO is staying silent as well.

00:14:47.880 --> 00:14:49.670
﻿Oliver, thank you!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:52.000
﻿Don't do anything too crazy, Miss Aida.

00:14:55.380 --> 00:14:57.430
﻿Do you have air and water balls?

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.970
﻿Thanks.

00:15:00.970 --> 00:15:03.100
﻿- Take this too.
﻿- What is it?

00:15:03.100 --> 00:15:06.390
﻿Konpeito. Noredo said you
﻿could use something sweet.

00:15:06.390 --> 00:15:08.600
﻿Well, give some to Raraiya too then.

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:12.860
﻿Steer! Angle us more to the north!

00:15:12.980 --> 00:15:14.900
﻿Yes, madam!

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:22.370
﻿Luan, no matter what else you do,
﻿make sure not to hurt the batteries.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:24.290
﻿I won't let you get hurt either.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:30.170
﻿Kerbes, Ringo, both of you stay further away.

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:32.750
﻿They'll take us all down together like this.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:34.550
﻿I wouldn't mind that.

00:15:34.550 --> 00:15:36.760
﻿We'll be your shields!

00:15:36.760 --> 00:15:38.880
﻿You call yourselves soldiers?

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:41.050
﻿They'll let us eat ocean fish?

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:42.050
﻿Fish?!

00:15:42.060 --> 00:15:44.520
﻿We can eat fish? What's going on?

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:45.890
﻿If you head to the G-IT Lab right away,

00:15:45.890 --> 00:15:47.020
﻿It's the G-IT Corps's boss.
﻿If you head to the G-IT Lab right away,

00:15:47.020 --> 00:15:49.520
﻿we'll let you eat some ocean fish.

00:15:49.520 --> 00:15:50.650
﻿What are your conditions?

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:54.480
﻿Well, if you'll just let us
﻿inspect that Earthnoid ship...

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:55.990
﻿It's a magnetic storm.

00:16:04.290 --> 00:16:08.290
﻿Since I've asked the G-IT Lab to send
﻿reinforcements, we can beat the Earthnoids.

00:16:09.580 --> 00:16:14.250
﻿Listen, our problem is Rosario Ten,
﻿which is sending out the Ten Police!

00:16:16.590 --> 00:16:21.140
﻿Once we leave the Venus Globe,
﻿the Ten Police will attack us again.

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:23.260
﻿Each of you prepare yourselves
﻿to eliminate them.

00:16:23.260 --> 00:16:23.970
﻿Yes, sir!

00:16:24.140 --> 00:16:29.100
﻿I will show those indulging in thousand
﻿year old dreams back on Rosario Ten

00:16:29.100 --> 00:16:33.440
﻿that in the real world you have
﻿to fight for what you want.

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:36.440
﻿The Earthnoids are parasites
﻿infesting the Earth.

00:16:36.440 --> 00:16:38.110
﻿I'm just going to delouse the planet.

00:16:41.530 --> 00:16:44.490
﻿I have some idea where Rosario Ten is now.

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:48.040
﻿But the Ten Police won't
﻿show up in this airspace.

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:50.290
﻿Megafauna, what is going on?

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:53.380
﻿- Listen, right now—
﻿- Use your imagination!

00:16:53.380 --> 00:16:55.170
﻿Use my imagination?

00:16:55.170 --> 00:16:56.880
﻿I've heard that line before...

00:17:10.940 --> 00:17:12.810
﻿The G-IT Corps's saber wielder?

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:20.740
﻿The Grod is an anti-Mobile Suit weapon!

00:17:20.740 --> 00:17:24.990
﻿G-IT Corps or whatever you are,
﻿we're still right beside the Venus Globe!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.410
﻿The G-IT Corps's boss man?

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:33.620
﻿Earthnoid.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:37.170
﻿If you enter the G-IT Lab
﻿with your G-Self.

00:17:37.170 --> 00:17:41.470
﻿I won't need to introduce you to the Gaeon's
﻿full array of weapons. What do you say?

00:17:43.130 --> 00:17:47.260
﻿How many of your own people from
﻿the Ocean Ring did you shoot down?

00:17:47.260 --> 00:17:48.350
﻿What?

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:51.180
﻿You're—!

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.480
﻿That machine...!

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:01.940
﻿It's just like Flaminia and Yaan said!

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:05.530
﻿We absolutely have to seize it and
﻿inspect it back at the G-IT Lab.

00:18:07.240 --> 00:18:10.490
﻿Commander Kia! Were you hit?! Chickara!

00:18:10.500 --> 00:18:12.330
﻿I know!

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:16.250
﻿He's tough!

00:18:16.840 --> 00:18:18.460
I won't let you do that!

00:18:20.170 --> 00:18:22.420
﻿What?! That barrier is so strong!

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:25.930
﻿You won't get away with that
﻿just because we can't fire beams!

00:18:26.890 --> 00:18:28.720
﻿Run, Aida!

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:36.810
Preparing to enter port.
﻿Switching to low pressure flight.

00:18:36.810 --> 00:18:39.900
﻿I-I was asleep?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.230
﻿Keep on course to the G-IT Lab.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:43.530
﻿Y-Yes sir.

00:18:44.150 --> 00:18:46.820
﻿I feel so pathetic.

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:50.620
﻿It's okay. No one understands everything.

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.960
﻿- Huh?
﻿- I-I can't take it anymore, Captain!

00:18:57.960 --> 00:19:00.040
﻿Let's try to imagine everything
﻿will work out for the best.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:04.800
﻿- What's wrong?
﻿- I-I'm not sure if I'm allowed to say.

00:19:04.800 --> 00:19:06.380
﻿Huh?

00:19:06.380 --> 00:19:09.890
﻿Doesn't matter. The shield still functions.

00:19:09.890 --> 00:19:13.140
﻿If I can take him out of the
﻿fight, the rest will keep quiet!

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:19.860
﻿With exterior images of the
﻿G-Self, we can analyze it, but...

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:22.570
We absolutely have to
﻿recover the cockpit core.

00:19:22.610 --> 00:19:25.190
﻿That's the only way to get the black box!

00:19:27.240 --> 00:19:29.570
﻿Kun Soon, monitor the Megafauna.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:32.330
﻿I will seize the G-Self's torso.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.740
﻿Just the torso?!

00:19:33.750 --> 00:19:38.330
﻿A Mobile Suit's head and limbs are just
﻿decorations! It's the computer that matters!

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.500
Close quarters combat?! Shield!

00:19:47.050 --> 00:19:49.640
﻿What? Why you...

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:56.020
﻿Th-There's no way the Gaeon could get
﻿taken out by anything Earthnoids made!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:02.810
﻿Fleeing into the Sea Disc's
﻿frame changes nothing!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:07.320
﻿This way I might not get killed, though!

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:14.200
﻿What's he doing when there's
﻿a sea right above us?!

00:20:18.120 --> 00:20:19.790
﻿This guy doesn't even
﻿think of the consequences!

00:20:25.670 --> 00:20:29.680
﻿If we follow the Poligit's lead,
﻿we'll be right under the Sea Disc.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:32.300
﻿Because the G-IT Corps won't
﻿attack us there, right?

00:20:32.300 --> 00:20:35.560
﻿It's inside the frame
﻿supporting the sea water.

00:20:35.560 --> 00:20:37.220
﻿Firing is strictly prohibited there.

00:20:37.560 --> 00:20:41.770
﻿The Poligit said to go to the Sea Disc
﻿where Rosario Ten is, right?

00:20:41.770 --> 00:20:44.820
﻿Yeah, that's right.
﻿Gisela, do you know the direction?

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:47.190
﻿- Lorucca.
﻿- That map!

00:20:47.190 --> 00:20:49.070
﻿Dead ahead! Beam fight!

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:50.950
- ﻿What?! That's absurd!
- ﻿Beams?!

00:20:58.160 --> 00:21:00.040
﻿These people are nuts.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:02.920
﻿I won't let them get in my sister's way!

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:05.960
﻿This is the bottom of the sea.

00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:07.880
﻿Retreat!

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:11.010
﻿Think you can stop here?

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.850
﻿I damaged the sea floor!

00:21:23.020 --> 00:21:25.650
﻿No! This is no good!

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:28.570
﻿This is the worst thing someone can do!

00:21:32.450 --> 00:21:35.240
I-If this gives me the opening
﻿to take him out...!

00:21:39.580 --> 00:21:41.910
﻿Don't flow out!

00:21:45.170 --> 00:21:46.420
﻿I can't catch him!

00:21:57.440 --> 00:21:59.310
﻿Th-This is...

00:22:00.480 --> 00:22:03.020
﻿I flew past the moon to get here...

00:22:03.020 --> 00:22:04.270
﻿What <i>is</i> this?

00:22:09.980 --> 00:22:11.990
﻿There are even migratory birds!

00:24:00.430 --> 00:24:02.760
﻿There was a sea in space as well.

00:24:02.760 --> 00:24:07.390
﻿I'm not there to invade, but I
﻿get attacked in a watery hell.

00:24:07.390 --> 00:24:10.600
The G-IT Lab even bring out a weapon
﻿that's like a huge frying pan,

00:24:10.600 --> 00:24:13.270
﻿trying to cook me to death.

00:24:13.270 --> 00:24:15.860
﻿They're trying to seal the
﻿hole in the bottom of the sea,

00:24:15.860 --> 00:24:18.280
﻿but I can't just go along with that!

00:24:19.110 --> 00:24:23.070
﻿Next time on Reconguista in G,
﻿The Weight of the Sea.

00:24:23.070 --> 00:24:25.330
﻿You should watch it with your friends!
